2026Friday, May 29, Page 1
Let us give priority to political construction, which is the central task that must be tackled in party building.
Strengthening the party, the general staff of the revolution, and constantly enhancing its leadership role are decisive guarantees for the victory of the socialist cause..
At the 9th Congress of the Party, the Respected Comrade General Secretary presented as the central task to be pursued in party construction during the 9th term of the Party Central Committee to achieve groundbreaking improvements in the strengthening and development of the Party by devising and perfectly implementing scientific, realistic and detailed measures to implement the principles and demands of the Five Great Party Building Platforms for the New Era in the Party's work and activities..
What is important in further strengthening and developing the party into a revolutionary staff with high leadership status and leadership power is to give priority to political construction..
Dear Comrade Kim Jong-un said the following:.
《Continuously deepening political construction and strengthening the party's fighting power., By strengthening the leadership in every possible way, the patriotic passion and wisdom of the entire people can be strengthened under the sole leadership of the Party Central Committee., We must ensure that the power and potential of all sectors are focused on the all-round development of socialism..》
In short, political construction of the party is the project of strengthening the party politically..In other words, it is a project to solidify a revolutionary political climate within the party that centers on the uniqueness of ideology and leadership and to acquire the stature and prestige of a leading political organization..
The project of strengthening and developing the party into an invincible revolutionary party with a solid monolithic leadership system and extraordinary organizational power and leadership skills is realized through the political construction of the party..Therefore, in order for our party to forever maintain its dignity and grandeur as a ruling party with absolute authority and mature leadership, it must pay primary attention to firmly maintaining and consolidating its unique political climate that centers on the uniqueness of ideology and leadership, and must establish and strengthen the system and foundation that can carry out its leadership functions and roles..
Above all, we must deepen the work to establish the central leadership system of the Party at a new height..
The monolithic leadership system of the party center is the backbone of our party's leadership, the core of its political style, and the foundation of the party's high dignity and strong fighting power..
Our party has long since deeply understood the importance of establishing discipline within the party to think and act as one under the leader's ideology and leadership, and has established the leader's unique ideological system throughout the party., A unique leadership system was thoroughly established..Therefore, the revolution and construction were able to move forward victoriously without any moment of stagnation or stagnation over dozens of long days..
The Party's intention is that there can be no completion in the project of establishing a monolithic leadership system of the Party Central Committee and that it must be continuously deepened at new heights..
Party organizations must unconditionally implement the Party's ideas and decisions, handle all issues arising from party work and activities strictly in accordance with the Party Central Committee's conclusions, and continue to carry out in depth the work of establishing strict order and discipline to operate as one under the sole leadership of the Party Central Committee..We must further strengthen the education of officials, party members, and workers so that the monolithic leadership system of the party center is constantly strengthened based on the passionate loyalty of the public, even as the situation changes and time passes..
Party committees at each level are the highest leadership bodies of the respective units., We must accurately carry out our functions and roles as a political staff..
Party committees at each level are held at the regional level., As the highest guidance agency of the unit organized according to the production and business unit, it has the mission of taking responsibility for, organizing and guiding the overall business for implementing the party's policies..Party committees are the highest leadership bodies of the respective units., All regions must satisfactorily perform their functions and roles as a political staff., The work of all units is carried out according to the intention of the Party Central Committee, so that the Party's political leadership in all areas of revolution and construction can be firmly realized..
Party committees, in principle, educate party members and workers about the true nature of the party's ideology and line and the importance of their implementation., We must prepare them to be thorough advocates of implementing the Party's policies by providing accurate explanations to the public and conducting thorough organizational work..In addition, institutions and organizations in each region and unit, We must strictly adhere to the system and order of controlling all organizations and providing unified leadership and control, actively promote democracy within the party, and properly proceed with all projects under the collective guidance of the party committee..Business with people who carry out our business thoroughly, Implementation of administration through political activities, We must thoroughly overcome administrative agency..
All party members must have high political awareness and fulfill their role as political activists..
Just as the walls are strong only when the stones are strong, each member of the party is a self-aware vanguard., Only by thinking and fighting at a high level as a political activist can the party successfully carry out its mission and role as a political staff..
The party's trust and expectations for our party members are very high in the struggle to implement the decisions of the 9th Party Congress..Party members believe in the party, They must always be aware of the call of the times and continuously improve their political sensitivity and level of political theory through consistent learning and self-discipline. By doing so, they must take on a heavy burden and play a leading role in opening a breakthrough to solve the problems the party is concerned about and hoping for..
Party organizations have efficiently improved the method of operating party meetings in line with the demands of actual development, so that the process of preparing and conducting party meetings serves as an opportunity to raise political awareness among the party members., It is a process of political activity in which one fulfills one's party membership obligations and exercises one's rights., It must be a process that helps implement party decisions through conscious enthusiasm and creative opinions..
Correctly combining leadership and the public has always been an essential issue in the party's political leadership..
Party organizations and workers must actively implement in today's party work and activities the powerful leadership methods that our Party has created and confirmed its vitality during its long struggle to lead revolution and construction, thereby further developing and enriching them..And how to create and generalize new development standards and examples and lead the way., Learn along, By putting into practice the excellent methods created in the new era, including the experience exchange movement, the patriotism of the masses and the power and potential of all sectors must be fully focused on executing party decisions..In particular, officials and party members should serve the people devotedly and serve as mirrors for the public, actively encouraging and cultivating the virtues and good manners of helping and leading each other within the group, so that noble virtues and affection are constantly sublimated everywhere..
All party organizations and workers, Party members understand the importance and significance of the party's political construction., We must once again deeply recognize the originality and legitimacy of that theory and fulfill our responsibility and duty in further strengthening and developing the Workers' Party of Korea into a politically mature party..
Headquarters Reporter
